# R65: another team's application consuming a data product without an approved subscription request.
@prefix adp: <https://example.org/acme/data-platform#> .

adp:salesTeam a adp:ProductTeam .
adp:hrTeam a adp:ProductTeam .
adp:salesOrders a adp:DataProduct ; adp:resourceOwnedBy adp:salesTeam .
adp:hrApp a adp:AIAnalyticalApplication ; adp:resourceOwnedBy adp:hrTeam .
adp:hrAppIdentity a adp:ServicePrincipal ; adp:identityOf adp:hrApp ; adp:serviceConsumes adp:salesOrders .
